older/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:320/280\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">T2A지역 \n                            파푸아마을에서 북서쪽으로 전진</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하시다보면 \n                            테라산킵을 만나실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지하로 \n                            내려가는 워프존까지 엄청난 옵피디언</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수를 \n                            만나실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"545\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"212\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-